{"unit_id":"zhaofeng130__dsh-rea#card-zh","repo":"zhaofeng130/dsh-rea","commit":"41ad881a390b9c52aa1af79c4502fe0df2655b37","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rea 是面向 DSH 会话的 REA 适配插件，通过 skills provider 提供 reverse-engineer-anything 技能，并注册 rea 与 rea_doctor 两个工具。rea 可调用本机解析到的 REA CLI，接收命令参数并返回执行状态、标准输出和错误；超长输出会保存到文件并返回路径。rea_doctor 汇报运行时版本、候选入口、分析提供方和就绪检查。适合希望在 DSH 中调用 REA 处理各类软件与设备产物的开发者。使用前需自行准备 REA CLI 或 checkout；插件不安装 REA。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:33-45","lib/tools.js:40-44","lib/runtime.js:177-245"]}
{"unit_id":"zhaofeng130__dsh-rea#card-en","repo":"zhaofeng130/dsh-rea","commit":"41ad881a390b9c52aa1af79c4502fe0df2655b37","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rea connects a local REA CLI to DSH. It provides the reverse-engineer-anything skill and two tools: rea runs commands and returns output, spilling oversized stdout to a file; rea_doctor reports runtime and provider readiness. Bring your own REA CLI; the plugin does not install it.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:33-45","lib/tools.js:40-44","lib/runtime.js:177-245"]}
