{"unit_id":"zhaofeng130__dsh-rea#caveat-1","repo":"zhaofeng130/dsh-rea","commit":"41ad881a390b9c52aa1af79c4502fe0df2655b37","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rea 不包含也不会安装 REA；运行工具前需自行准备可解析的 CLI 或 checkout，若都无法运行，命令会返回 runtime_unresolved 和处理建议。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/runtime.js:182-193","lib/runtime.js:108-131"]}
